<title>BELGIUM: IGC group prepares summit report.</title>
<headline>IGC group prepares summit report.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-09-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The group of foreign ministers' representatives on the inter-governmental conference (IGC) were to meet on Monday and Tuesday to begin preparations for the special European Council in Dublin on October 5.</p>
<p>European Union officials said the group would prepare a draft report for the Dublin Council on the status of IGC negotiations, which began in March.</p>
<p>The report is to be finished off by foreign ministers at the General Affairs Council in Luxembourg on October 1.</p>
</text>
